   "properties": {
    "Node name for S&R": "MarkdownNote"
   },
   "widgets_values": [
    "## Wire into your LTX graph\n\nConnect your LTX **positive / negative** (text encoded with the Camera → Prompt text appended) and the LTX **VAE** into **LTX Guides**. Its outputs replace the conditioning and latent going into your LTX sampler.\n\n- Setup target = LTX keeps length on 8k+1 and size on 32 px.\n- Guides every 1 s at strength 0.7; frame 0 at 1.0 locks the look.\n- Swap Guide Frames for a Feedback render or a Storyboard to guide with other images."
   ]
  },
